External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
UI/modbus.html loads jQuery and jQuery UI (js/jquery.js,
js/jquery-ui.min.js, js/jquery-ui.min.css) at runtime. These files are
shipped by the ueiroot-wwwfs package under their own license (MIT) and are
not covered by this file.


Files not built for the ARM (SoloX) target
------------------------------------------
tests/, doc/, distribution/, CMake and Visual Studio project files are not
part of the Yocto package and are not covered by this summary.


